type: software
title: "Monsoon Ledger"
abstract: >-
  A public, bilingual tracker of how Indonesia governs AI. It checks what officials promise
  about AI regulation against what happens, records the evidence level of every claim, and
  publishes analysis papers on AI incident reporting.
